{"seq":3,"slug":"middleware-patterns","title":"中间件模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/middleware-patterns","wordCount":1520,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"中间件模式\">中间件模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>中间件（Middleware）是处理 ML 服务请求-响应链路中横切关注点的软件组件。在 ML 系统中，模型推理只是请求处理的核心一环，围绕它还有认证鉴权、速率限制、请求转换、缓存、日志记录、熔断降级等一系列基础设施需求。中间件模式将这些关注点封装为可组合的独立组件，形成清晰的责任链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt; B[认证]&#10;    B --&gt; C[限流]&#10;    C --&gt; D[缓存查询]&#10;    D --&gt; E{缓存命中?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[返回缓存]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[特征获取]&#10;    G --&gt; H[模型推理]&#10;    H --&gt; I[结果缓存]&#10;    I --&gt; J[日志记录]&#10;    J --&gt; K[响应返回]\">graph LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt; B[认证]\n    B --&gt; C[限流]\n    C --&gt; D[缓存查询]\n    D --&gt; E{缓存命中?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[返回缓存]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[特征获取]\n    G --&gt; H[模型推理]\n    H --&gt; I[结果缓存]\n    I --&gt; J[日志记录]\n    J --&gt; K[响应返回]</pre><p>中间件的核心价值是关注点分离——每个中间件只负责一项职责，通过组合形成完整的处理链路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中间件类型</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>对延迟的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>认证鉴权</td>\n<td>验证请求身份</td>\n<td>链路入口</td>\n<td>+1-5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>防止过载</td>\n<td>认证之后</td>\n<td>+0.1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求验证</td>\n<td>校验输入格式</td>\n<td>限流之后</td>\n<td>+0.5ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存</td>\n<td>复用历史结果</td>\n<td>推理之前</td>\n<td>-大量（命中时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征增强</td>\n<td>补充请求特征</td>\n<td>推理之前</td>\n<td>+5-50ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型路由</td>\n<td>选择模型版本</td>\n<td>推理之前</td>\n<td>+0.1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>熔断降级</td>\n<td>故障保护</td>\n<td>推理包装</td>\n<td>+0.1ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志追踪</td>\n<td>记录请求详情</td>\n<td>链路出口</td>\n<td>+0.5ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"认证鉴权与访问控制\">认证鉴权与访问控制</h2><p>ML API 的认证鉴权需要处理两类场景：外部客户端访问（通过 API Key 或 OAuth 2.0 Token）和内部服务间调用（通过 mTLS 或 Service Account）。认证解决&quot;你是谁&quot;的问题，鉴权解决&quot;你能做什么&quot;的问题。</p>\n<p>对于 ML 服务，鉴权的粒度通常包括：模型级别（是否有权访问特定模型）、版本级别（是否有权访问生产版本或实验版本）和操作级别（是否有权执行推理、查询元数据或修改模型配置）。基于角色的访问控制（RBAC）将权限打包为角色，再将角色分配给用户或服务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from functools import wraps&#10;&#10;class AuthMiddleware:&#10;    def __init__(self, auth_service):&#10;        self.auth_service = auth_service&#10;&#10;    async def __call__(self, request, next_handler):&#10;        token = request.headers.get(&quot;Authorization&quot;, &quot;&quot;).replace(&quot;Bearer &quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;        if not token:&#10;            return Response(status=401, body={&quot;error&quot;: &quot;Missing authentication&quot;})&#10;&#10;        identity = await self.auth_service.verify_token(token)&#10;        if not identity:&#10;            return Response(status=401, body={&quot;error&quot;: &quot;Invalid token&quot;})&#10;&#10;        model_name = request.path_params.get(&quot;model_name&quot;)&#10;        if not self.auth_service.check_permission(identity, model_name, &quot;predict&quot;):&#10;            return Response(status=403, body={&quot;error&quot;: &quot;Permission denied&quot;})&#10;&#10;        request.identity = identity&#10;        return await next_handler(request)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> functools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wraps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuthMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, auth_service):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.auth_service </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auth_service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __call__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, request, next_handler):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.headers.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Authorization\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).replace(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bearer \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> token:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">401</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Missing authentication\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        identity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.auth_service.verify_token(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">401</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Invalid token\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        model_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.path_params.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.auth_service.check_permission(identity, model_name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"predict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">403</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Permission denied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        request.identity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> identity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_handler(request)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>API Key 轮转和审计日志是安全运维的重要组成部分。API Key 应设置有效期并支持自动轮转，所有认证事件（成功和失败）都应记录到审计日志中，用于安全审计和异常检测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速率限制与请求队列\">速率限制与请求队列</h2><p>速率限制（Rate Limiting）保护 ML 服务免受流量突增的冲击。ML 推理通常是计算密集型操作，GPU 资源有限，不受控的请求涌入会导致推理延迟飙升甚至服务崩溃。</p>\n<p>令牌桶算法（Token Bucket）是最常用的速率限制策略。它为每个客户端维护一个令牌桶，桶按固定速率补充令牌，每个请求消耗一个令牌。当桶中没有令牌时，新请求被拒绝或排队。令牌桶的两个参数——桶容量（Burst Size）和补充速率（Rate）——控制了短时间突发流量和持续流量的上限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import time&#10;from collections import defaultdict&#10;&#10;class TokenBucketRateLimiter:&#10;    def __init__(self, rate, burst):&#10;        self.rate = rate&#10;        self.burst = burst&#10;        self.buckets = defaultdict(lambda: {&quot;tokens&quot;: burst, &quot;last_time&quot;: time.time()})&#10;&#10;    def allow(self, client_id):&#10;        bucket = self.buckets[client_id]&#10;        now = time.time()&#10;        elapsed = now - bucket[&quot;last_time&quot;]&#10;        bucket[&quot;tokens&quot;] = min(self.burst, bucket[&quot;tokens&quot;] + elapsed * self.rate)&#10;        bucket[&quot;last_time&quot;] = now&#10;&#10;        if bucket[&quot;tokens&quot;] &gt;= 1:&#10;            bucket[&quot;tokens&quot;] -= 1&#10;            return True&#10;        return False&#10;&#10;class RateLimitMiddleware:&#10;    def __init__(self, limiter):&#10;        self.limiter = limiter&#10;&#10;    async def __call__(self, request, next_handler):&#10;        client_id = request.identity.client_id&#10;        if not self.limiter.allow(client_id):&#10;            return Response(&#10;                status=429,&#10;                body={&quot;error&quot;: &quot;Rate limit exceeded&quot;},&#10;                headers={&quot;Retry-After&quot;: &quot;1&quot;},&#10;            )&#10;        return await next_handler(request)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defaultdict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TokenBucketRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, rate, burst):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.burst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> burst</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.buckets </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defaultdict(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: burst, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: time.time()})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, client_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.buckets[client_id]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.burst, bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"last_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            bucket[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tokens\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RateLimitMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, limiter):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limiter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limiter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __call__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, request, next_handler):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        client_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.identity.client_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limiter.allow(client_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">429</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Rate limit exceeded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Retry-After\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_handler(request)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于多模型服务，速率限制需要按模型维度设置不同的限额。大模型的推理成本远高于小模型，应该设置更低的速率限制。优先级队列可以让高优先级请求在限流条件下仍能获得服务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{令牌可用?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[消耗令牌]&#10;    C --&gt; D[继续处理]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| E{有优先级?}&#10;    E --&gt;|高优先级| F[优先队列]&#10;    E --&gt;|普通| G[返回 429]&#10;    F --&gt; D\">graph TB\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{令牌可用?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[消耗令牌]\n    C --&gt; D[继续处理]\n    B --&gt;|否| E{有优先级?}\n    E --&gt;|高优先级| F[优先队列]\n    E --&gt;|普通| G[返回 429]\n    F --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"缓存策略与结果复用\">缓存策略与结果复用</h2><p>推理结果缓存是降低 ML 服务成本和延迟的高效手段。当相同的输入产生确定性的输出时（如文本分类、图像识别），缓存可以完全避免重复推理。即使模型输出不完全确定性（如含采样的生成模型），近似缓存也能减少大部分重复计算。</p>\n<p>缓存键的设计是核心挑战。最简单的方案是将输入数据的哈希值作为缓存键，但对于复杂输入（如图像），计算完整哈希的成本不低。实践中常用的策略是多级缓存键：先用轻量级特征（如文本长度 + 前 N 个字符的哈希）快速匹配，命中后再验证完整输入的一致性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import hashlib&#10;import json&#10;&#10;class InferenceCacheMiddleware:&#10;    def __init__(self, cache_backend, ttl_seconds=3600):&#10;        self.cache = cache_backend&#10;        self.ttl = ttl_seconds&#10;&#10;    def _compute_cache_key(self, model_name, model_version, input_data):&#10;        payload = json.dumps({&#10;            &quot;model&quot;: f&quot;{model_name}:{model_version}&quot;,&#10;            &quot;input&quot;: input_data,&#10;        }, sort_keys=True)&#10;        return hashlib.sha256(payload.encode()).hexdigest()&#10;&#10;    async def __call__(self, request, next_handler):&#10;        cache_key = self._compute_cache_key(&#10;            request.model_name, request.model_version, request.input_data&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        cached = await self.cache.get(cache_key)&#10;        if cached:&#10;            return Response(body=cached, headers={&quot;X-Cache&quot;: &quot;HIT&quot;})&#10;&#10;        response = await next_handler(request)&#10;        await self.cache.set(cache_key, response.body, ttl=self.ttl)&#10;        return response\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InferenceCacheMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, cache_backend, ttl_seconds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cache </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cache_backend</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ttl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ttl_seconds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _compute_cache_key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_name, model_version, input_data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.dumps({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_version</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: input_data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sort_keys</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hashlib.sha256(payload.encode()).hexdigest()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __call__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, request, next_handler):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cache_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._compute_cache_key(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            request.model_name, request.model_version, request.input_data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cached </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cache.get(cache_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cached:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Response(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">body</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cached, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"X-Cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_handler(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.cache.set(cache_key, response.body, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ttl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.ttl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response</span></span></code></pre></div><p>缓存失效策略需要考虑模型更新。当模型版本升级时，旧版本的缓存应该失效。通过将模型版本纳入缓存键的计算，可以自然地实现版本感知的缓存失效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缓存策略</th>\n<th>命中率</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>一致性保证</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确匹配</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>分类/检测任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近似匹配</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>相似查询去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义缓存</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>LLM 常见问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征级缓存</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>特征计算复用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"熔断降级与容错\">熔断降级与容错</h2><p>熔断器（Circuit Breaker）模式防止 ML 服务在依赖的下游服务故障时级联崩溃。当模型推理或特征服务的错误率超过阈值时，熔断器&quot;断开&quot;，后续请求直接返回降级结果而不实际调用故障服务，避免无用的重试和资源浪费。</p>\n<p>熔断器有三个状态：关闭（正常通过请求）、打开（直接返回降级结果）和半开（允许少量探测请求验证服务是否恢复）。状态转换由错误率和超时时间控制。</p>\n<p>降级策略是熔断器的配套设计。对于 ML 服务，常见的降级方案包括：返回缓存的最近结果、使用更简单的备用模型（如规则引擎或小模型）、返回默认值（如推荐系统返回热门商品列表）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class CircuitBreaker:&#10;    def __init__(self, failure_threshold=5, recovery_timeout=30):&#10;        self.failure_threshold = failure_threshold&#10;        self.recovery_timeout = recovery_timeout&#10;        self.failure_count = 0&#10;        self.state = &quot;closed&quot;&#10;        self.last_failure_time = 0&#10;&#10;    async def call(self, func, fallback, *args, **kwargs):&#10;        if self.state == &quot;open&quot;:&#10;            if time.time() - self.last_failure_time &gt; self.recovery_timeout:&#10;                self.state = &quot;half_open&quot;&#10;            else:&#10;                return await fallback(*args, **kwargs)&#10;&#10;        try:&#10;            result = await func(*args, **kwargs)&#10;            if self.state == &quot;half_open&quot;:&#10;                self.state = &quot;closed&quot;&#10;                self.failure_count = 0&#10;            return result&#10;        except Exception:&#10;            self.failure_count += 1&#10;            self.last_failure_time = time.time()&#10;            if self.failure_count &gt;= self.failure_threshold:&#10;                self.state = &quot;open&quot;&#10;            return await fallback(*args, **kwargs)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CircuitBreaker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, failure_threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, recovery_timeout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> failure_threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.recovery_timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recovery_timeout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"closed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_failure_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, func, fallback, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_failure_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.recovery_timeout:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"half_open\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> func(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"half_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"closed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        except</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.last_failure_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.time()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.failure_threshold:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"open\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">args, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A((关闭)) --&gt;|错误率超阈值| B((打开))&#10;    B --&gt;|超时后| C((半开))&#10;    C --&gt;|探测成功| A&#10;    C --&gt;|探测失败| B\">graph LR\n    A((关闭)) --&gt;|错误率超阈值| B((打开))\n    B --&gt;|超时后| C((半开))\n    C --&gt;|探测成功| A\n    C --&gt;|探测失败| B</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((中间件模式))&#10;    安全层&#10;      认证鉴权&#10;      RBAC 权限&#10;      审计日志&#10;    流量控制&#10;      令牌桶限流&#10;      优先级队列&#10;      按模型限额&#10;    性能优化&#10;      结果缓存&#10;      特征缓存&#10;      语义缓存&#10;    容错机制&#10;      熔断器&#10;      降级策略&#10;      备用模型\">mindmap\n  root((中间件模式))\n    安全层\n      认证鉴权\n      RBAC 权限\n      审计日志\n    流量控制\n      令牌桶限流\n      优先级队列\n      按模型限额\n    性能优化\n      结果缓存\n      特征缓存\n      语义缓存\n    容错机制\n      熔断器\n      降级策略\n      备用模型</pre><ul>\n<li>中间件模式将请求链路中的横切关注点封装为可组合的独立组件，实现关注点分离</li>\n<li>认证鉴权需要支持模型级和版本级的细粒度权限控制，API Key 应支持自动轮转</li>\n<li>速率限制保护 GPU 资源免受流量冲击，令牌桶是最常用的限流算法</li>\n<li>推理结果缓存可以显著降低成本和延迟，缓存键设计需要纳入模型版本信息</li>\n<li>熔断降级防止级联故障，降级策略应预先设计并定期测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"中间件模式","id":"中间件模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"认证鉴权与访问控制","id":"认证鉴权与访问控制"},{"level":2,"text":"速率限制与请求队列","id":"速率限制与请求队列"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略与结果复用","id":"缓存策略与结果复用"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断降级与容错","id":"熔断降级与容错"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/lifecycle-management"},"next":{"title":"可观测性与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/harness-and-orchestration/observability-monitoring"}}